{"step_index":520,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T18:32:04Z","thinking":"**Defining the Project Structure**\n\nI'm now focusing on creating `src-csharp/Spectra.csproj`. I've determined it should target `net8.0-windows` (or `.NET 8 WindowsDesktop`) to utilize WPF and WindowsForms for essential system hooks and screen capture functionalities. The next step is detailing the required dependencies.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"@\"\n<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n\n  <PropertyGroup>\n    <OutputType>WinExe</OutputType>\n    <TargetFramework>net8.0-windows</TargetFramework>\n    <UseWPF>true</UseWPF>\n    <UseWindowsForms>true</UseWindowsForms>\n    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>\n    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n    <AssemblyName>Spectra</AssemblyName>\n    <RootNamespace>Spectra</RootNamespace>\n    <ApplicationIcon>..\\assets\\spectra_icon.ico</ApplicationIcon>\n    <PublishSingleFile>true</PublishSingleFile>\n    <SelfContained>true</SelfContained>\n    <RuntimeIdentifier>win-x64</RuntimeIdentifier>\n  </PropertyGroup>\n\n  <ItemGroup>\n    <PackageReference Include=\"Microsoft.Web.WebView2\" Version=\"1.0.2903.40\" />\n    <PackageReference Include=\"NAudio\" Version=\"2.2.1\" />\n  </ItemGroup>\n\n  <ItemGroup>\n    <Content Include=\"..\\web\\**\\*.*\">\n      <CopyToOutputDirectory>PreserveNewest</CopyToOutputDirectory>\n      <Link>web\\%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)</Link>\n    </Content>\n    <Content Include=\"..\\ai_providers.json\">\n      <CopyToOutputDirectory>PreserveNewest</CopyToOutputDirectory>\n      <Link>ai_providers.json</Link>\n    </Content>\n  </ItemGroup>\n\n</Project>\n\"@ | Out-File -Encoding utf8 \"src-csharp\\Spectra.csproj\"","Cwd":"c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Writing Spectra.csproj","toolSummary":"Create Spectra.csproj"}}]}
